--- nothing to parse ---
empty: expected a value but the text ended at position 0
blank: expected a value but the text ended at position 3
--- numbers ---
leading zero: unexpected text after the value at position 1
bare minus: a number needs a digit here at position 1
no digits: a number needs a digit here at position 1
trailing point: a decimal point needs a digit after it at position 2
bare exponent: an exponent needs a digit after it at position 2
exponent sign only: an exponent needs a digit after it at position 3
leading plus: `+` does not start a value at position 0
hex: unexpected text after the value at position 1
infinity: `i` does not start a value at position 0
nan: `N` does not start a value at position 0
too large: `1e999` is too large for a float at position 0
--- strings ---
unclosed: a string was never closed at position 4
bad escape: `\q` is not an escape at position 1
short hex: `\u` needs four hex digits after it at position 1
not hex: `\u` needs four hex digits after it at position 1
lone high surrogate: a high surrogate needs a `\u` after it at position 1
lone low surrogate: a low surrogate has nothing in front of it at position 1
half a pair: a high surrogate needs a `\u` after it at position 1
raw tab: a control character has to be escaped inside a string at position 2
dangling backslash: a string ends with a lone backslash at position 2
--- arrays ---
unclosed: an array was never closed at position 5
trailing comma: `]` does not start a value at position 3
missing comma: expected `,` or `]` in an array at position 3
just a comma: `,` does not start a value at position 1
closed wrong: expected `,` or `]` in an array at position 2
--- objects ---
unclosed: an object was never closed at position 7
bare key: expected a quoted field name at position 1
no colon: expected `:` after a field name at position 5
no value: `}` does not start a value at position 5
trailing comma: expected a quoted field name at position 8
missing comma: expected `,` or `}` in an object at position 8
--- words ---
truncated: expected `true` at position 0
capitalised: `T` does not start a value at position 0
undefined: `u` does not start a value at position 0
--- more than one value ---
two values: unexpected text after the value at position 2
trailing text: unexpected text after the value at position 9
two documents: unexpected text after the value at position 2
--- too deep ---
at the limit (200): parsed
past it (201): values nest more than 200 deep at position 201
hostile (5000): values nest more than 200 deep at position 201
